category: Libs
build-depends: cygport cxxopts libevent-devel libgtest-devel libhwloc-devel libopenmpi-devel libscalapack-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Distributed Communication-Optimal Shuffle and Transpose Algorithm (utilities)"
ldesc: "COSTA is a communication-optimal, highly-optimised algorithm for data
redistribution accross multiple processors, using MPI and OpenMP and offering
the possibility to transpose and scale some or all data."
